{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-06-02-was-not-sure-why-i-md-0fb9fb70e9:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Was not sure why I did this video last year in Vietnam… But this is really me… re-starting myself again from 0 on a new level. Being born in a small city… I’m the end of Communism regime, would never believe I would be where I’m now. Never had it easy… But now I’m so thankful that I never had - a privilege passport - perfect English - rich husband And if put all my experiences together I’ve been living 5 lives Growing up in a Small city, moved to capital at 20, moved to India at 30, moved to Dubai at 34, started my own business at 40. And Now I feel I’m back to 0 on another level. Building my media and coaching Empire….", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-02-was-not-sure-why-i-md-0fb9fb70e9:u000001"}], "text": "The author expresses a sense of disbelief about their current status, given their origins in a small city at the end of the Communist regime, and lists several personal milestones such as moving from a small city to various major cities and starting a business."}, "title": "Life experiences", "topic": "life_experience"}, "content_hash": "65ddfe645b051a6cea6d1602a169b72873ef823e16a2c27cc1c78a2f9499cf5e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-02-was-not-sure-why-i-md-0fb9fb70e9:knowledge:57ac92c64fb8f82b", "metadata_hash": "f7d775fd8bfd380f9ee640916e7fd2740f706fc4988bf812b337526776e86f36", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-02T06:19:37Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "8c4672819c1ef73de204e4a2070c60e21522fa35976cf291690114bc7ad0d514", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-02-was-not-sure-why-i-md-0fb9fb70e9", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZEpTtzCbwh/", "title": "Life experiences", "topic": "life_experience", "topic_slug": "life_experience"}
